                        ^
HINT:  No operator matches the given name and argument types. You might need to add explicit type casts.
-- @@@ 18
select '1'::xid > '2'::xid;
ERROR:  operator does not exist: xid > xid
LINE 1: select '1'::xid > '2'::xid;
                        ^
HINT:  No operator matches the given name and argument types. You might need to add explicit type casts.
-- @@@ 19
select '1'::xid >= '2'::xid;
ERROR:  operator does not exist: xid >= xid
